>## True if a ClassItem is the single literal character code point c (not a range).
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term classItemIsLiteral = λc,item.cases(regex.ClassItem){character=λic.equality.equal ic c, `_`=false} item
